The reset hook is the existing FLICKER-01 experimental source seam. FLICKER-02
changes only the runtime mode: F2-A leaves the probe scissor active; F2-B sets
the full active target scissor after the callback. The ordered and post-scene
dispatch sites use the same hook. No generic GPU state restore is included.
